{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264Thj2cJqU31793632393.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天文台總部下午錄得最高氣溫31.1度，是有記錄以來11月第二高。</p><p></p><p>天文台指本港風勢微弱，上水最高錄得34.6度，打破1980年代設置自動氣象站以來，11月最高氣溫紀錄。其次為坪州33.5度，打鼓嶺、元朗都超過33度。</p><p></p><p>天文台又稱，一股偏東氣流晚間抵達廣東沿岸，轉吹和緩至清勁東至東北風，下周初氣溫稍為下降。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:01:05.746487+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T14:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T20:18:19.884747+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T15:58:28.833716+00:00","content_hash":"10dc32591bec53e5242071f40eb15e7cab237e42a1f75951322885b7a24bd664","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}